		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Long-necked, bipedal, hairless jackal. Undead born from rageful mortals denied last rites out of spite.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 29, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +4 (1d8 + paralyze), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Create Spawn</strong>. Slain mortals rise as vrykolakas in 1d4 days unless given last rites.</p><p></p><p><strong>Possession</strong>. If reduced to 0 HP, vrykolakas 's spirit flies into animal within near range. Contested CHA check. If undead wins, inhabits and controls animal, transforms into undead over 1d4 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p><p><strong>Vulnerable</strong>. Double damage from fire.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
